WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.934 --> 00:00:02.402
-Well, it's the end of the week,

00:00:02.402 --> 00:00:03.670
and that's usually when I catch
up with some personal stuff.

00:00:03.670 --> 00:00:05.071
You know, I check my in-box,
return some e-mails,

00:00:05.071 --> 00:00:07.006
and, of course,
I send out thank-you notes.

00:00:07.006 --> 00:00:08.575
And I was running a bit behind,
so I thought,

00:00:08.575 --> 00:00:10.075
if you guys wouldn't mind,
I'd like to write out

00:00:10.075 --> 00:00:12.645
some thank-you notes right now,
if that's cool with you guys.

00:00:12.645 --> 00:00:13.713
James, can I get some

00:00:13.713 --> 00:00:14.947
thank-you-note-writing
music, please?

00:00:14.947 --> 00:00:18.351
[ Soft piano playing ]

00:00:18.351 --> 00:00:22.388
Oh.

00:00:22.388 --> 00:00:26.159
Thank you, Kamala Harris,
for being

00:00:26.159 --> 00:00:28.461
half-Jamaican and half-Indian,

00:00:28.461 --> 00:00:31.631
whereas Mike Pence
is just half-and-half.

00:00:37.403 --> 00:00:38.637
[ Soft piano playing ]

00:00:38.637 --> 00:00:41.340
Thank you, Joe Biden,
for always looking like

00:00:41.340 --> 00:00:43.509
you just came from
a "Top Gun" audition

00:00:43.509 --> 00:00:45.845
you think you totally nailed.

00:00:49.181 --> 00:00:53.118
Nailed it.

00:00:53.118 --> 00:00:54.320
[ Soft piano playing ]

00:00:54.320 --> 00:00:58.024
Thank you, Women for Trump bus,
for looking like

00:00:58.024 --> 00:00:59.659
an optional accessory
you can buy

00:00:59.659 --> 00:01:02.529
for Alt-Right Blogger Barbie.

00:01:07.066 --> 00:01:08.367
[ Soft piano playing ]

00:01:08.367 --> 00:01:12.372
Thank you, Shark Week in 2020,
for somehow managing

00:01:12.372 --> 00:01:14.541
to make TV shows about
deadly shark attacks

00:01:14.541 --> 00:01:17.077
feel like a relaxing escape.

00:01:21.313 --> 00:01:22.649
[ Soft piano playing ]

00:01:22.649 --> 00:01:25.551
Thank you, study that found
McDonald's packaging

00:01:25.551 --> 00:01:27.620
contains toxic chemicals

00:01:27.620 --> 00:01:30.824
or, as their hamburgers
put it, "Twinsies!"

00:01:38.030 --> 00:01:39.299
[ Soft piano playing ]

00:01:39.299 --> 00:01:42.735
Thank you, beluga whale being
rescued this week,

00:01:42.735 --> 00:01:44.804
for looking like your
drunk friend at the party

00:01:44.804 --> 00:01:46.672
who needed help
getting his jacket on.

00:01:46.672 --> 00:01:49.809
[ Laughs ]

00:01:49.809 --> 00:01:51.277
There you have it.
Those are my thank-you notes.

